{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“三角分解”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"三角分解"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>三角分解是将 Lie 代数分为三部分: "},{"Local":{"url":"Cartan子代数","text":"Cartan 子代数"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak h$, 以及两个幂零子代数 $\\mathfrak n_+,\\mathfrak n_-$, 对应正负"},{"Local":{"url":"根系","text":"根"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}